---
layout: default_portfolio
---
<div class="post">
  {%- comment -%}
    The portfolio index carries its own visual identity, so the page title and
    description are hidden from sight — but kept in the markup, and in the
    accessibility tree, so crawlers still index them and screen readers still
    announce the page. See `.visually-hidden` in _sass/_base.scss.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <header class="post-header visually-hidden">
    <h1 class="post-title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
    <p class="post-description">{{ page.description }}</p>
  </header>

  <article>
    {{ content }}
  </article>
</div>
